{
  "id": "NUM.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Orubara 22",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baimukya, orusisira barutera bolekeire Yeriko omu mpita za Moabu buseli bwa Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki eya Sipori hakaba yaboine ebyo Abaisiraeli bakozire Abaamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoabu batina muno Abaisiraeli, enshonga bakaba bali bangi, babahahanisa emyoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoabu bagambira abakuru ba Midiani bati, “Omugana ogu gw'embwa nigwija kuramba ebyo twinabyo okwo ente ekuuta obunyasi mbali yaliira.” Omu biro ebyo omukama wa Moabu hakaba ali Balaki eya Sipori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatuma entumwa ahali Balaamu eya Beori, ayabaire atwire Petori, aha Mwiga gwa Efurati omu nsi ya Amawi, kumweta. Amuragiraho ati, “Haliho abantu barugire Misiri, ensi bagijwire, mara batwire omu maisho gaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu oije, ondaamire abantu aba, kuba nibankira amani, shana nakushobora kubasinga n'okubaihya omu nsi egi, aha rw'okuba nimanya okwo ow'oha omugisha ahabwa omugisha, n'ow'oraama araamwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru ba Moabu n'aba Midiani bakwata emikimba y'okuha omufumu bagenda. Bagoba omwa Balaamu bamugambira ebyo Balaki yabatuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagambira ati, “Kir'eki murare hanunju, ndabahorora nyenkya okwo Omukama arangambira.” Kityo abatwazi ba Moabu barara omwa Balaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga aija ahali Balaamu amubaza ati, “Abantu aba ab'oinabo ni bahai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu ahorora Ruhanga ati, “Balaki eya Sipori, omukama wa Moabu antumireho ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Haliho abantu barugire Misiri, ensi bagijwire. Mbwenu oije obandaamire, shana nakushobora kubarashanisa nkababinga.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga agambira Balaamu ati, “Otagenda nabo mara otakuraama bantu abo ahakuba baina omugisha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bwankya Balaamu agambira abatwazi ba Balaki ati, “Mushube owanyu kuba Omukama yantanga kugenda na inywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abatwazi ba Moabu baimukya bashuba owa Balaki bamugambira bati, “Balaamu yayanga kwija na ichwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki ashuba atuma abatwazi abandi, abangi kushaga aba mbere mara ab'ekitinwa kukiraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baija omwa Balaamu bamugambira bati, “Balaki eya Sipori nagamba ati, ‘Hatabaho kya kukutanga kwija; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndakuha ekitinwa kingi, mara nkore kyona kyona eky'orangambira. Oije ondaamire abantu aba.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Balaamu ahorora abairu ba Balaki ati, “N'orwo Balaki yakumpaire enjuye eijwire efeza n'ezahabu, tinakugireyo kuchwa muhango gw'Omukama Ruhanga wange, n'akati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu nimbashaba mushube murare hanu na kir'eki, manye kushagaho ekyo Omukama arangambira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga aija ahali Balaamu omu kiro amugambira ati, “K'abantu aba baraba baizire kukweta, imuka ogende nabo; ekyo ndakuragira kyonkai nikyo orakora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwankya Balaamu aimuka, ateka amatandiko aha ndogobe, agenda n'abatwazi ba Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai okugendakwe kunigaza muno Ruhanga n'omumalaika w'Omukama ayemelera omu muhanda kumutanga. Akaba akuubire endogobeye aina n'abairube babili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endogobe ebona omumalaika w'Omukama ayemeleire omu muhanda, akwete embanda eshohorogokire omu ruraro. Endogobe eruga omu muhanda egya omu kikamba. Balaamu agitera kugigarura omu muhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omumalaika w'Omukama ayemelera omu kahanda kafunzire omugati y'omusiri gw'emizabibu, n'orukuta rumuli oku n'oku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo endogobe yaboine omumalaika ogwo w'Omukama esima orukuta, etekelera Balaamu okuguru aha rukuta orwo. Balaamu ashuba agitera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omumalaika w'Omukama agenda omu maisho, ayemelera ahafunzire muno, ahataina buhindukiro obulyo anga obumosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo endogobe yamuboine ebwarama ahansi okwo Balaamu akagili aha mugongo. Balaamu atamwa muno agiteza enkoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akomorora endogobe akanwa. Ebaza Balaamu eti, “Nakukoleraki kuntera emirundi eshatu egi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu agihorora ati, “Kuba wanzanisa. Kanakuba naba nkwete embanda nakukwisire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endogobe emubaza eti, “Tindi ndogobe yawe ey'otuura nokuuba oburora bwawe bwona kugoba mbwenu? Ebi ndabikukozire?” Agihorora ati, “Chei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama aburuza Balaamu amaisho, abona omumalaika ayemeleire omu muhanda, akwete embanda eshohorogokire omu ruraro; ainama, agwa ahansi ajumaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumalaika w'Omukama amubaza ati, “Emirundi eshatu egi endogobe yawe wagiteleraki? Naija kukutanga omu muhanda aha rw'okuba mbali olikugya tindikwendayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endogobe yambona emirundi eshatu neshuba aha rubaju. Kuba etashuba kashatu aha rubaju kumpigiza, mazima mbwenu aha nakuba nakwisire mara yonene ngileka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu agambira omumalaika w'Omukama ati, “Nafakara, kyonkai naba ntalikumanya okwo waba nompimbira muhanda. Aha rw'ekyo orwo olikubona okwo ndikukora kubi, nagaruka omuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumalaika w'Omukama amugambira ati, “Abantu abo ogende nabo; nawe ekigambo ekyo ndakuragira kyonkai obe nikyo ogamba.” Aho Balaamu agenda n'abatwazi ba Balaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Balaki yahuliire okwo Balaamu yaija, agenda Ari kumuchwekera aha Mwiga gwa Arinoni orubibi rwa Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki abaza Balaamu ati, “Orwo nakutumireho kubaki tiwaizire?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu amushubamu ati, “Mbwenu naija! Nyina obushobora kugira ekyo nagamba kyona kyona? Ekigambo ekyo Ruhanga arandagira kugamba nikyo ndagamba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Balaamu agenda na Balaki bagya Kiriatihuzoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki atamba enumi n'entaama, atumaho Balaamu n'abatwazi abo yabaire ainabo kubaha enyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
